comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-05T09:25:31.280Z",codex-sol,"The caller example intentionally uses release commit and exact version placeholders. The currently published extension predates the gate, and this work is authorized only in the pm-github worktree. No pilot workflow in another repository was changed, enabled, or dispatched. Resolve the placeholders only after a reviewed release and separately authorized caller adoption."
  "2026-10-17T00:39:26.413Z",codex-agent,"Additional release-adoption dependency from pm-github-c093: the default-branch pm-github-sync callers in pm-beads, pm-brief, pm-context, pm-csv, pm-linear and pm-slack-standup all pin workflow SHA 67a5e3e1514fddeeae29951da00513f06f7aa0ab and pm-github-version 2026.10.16. Regeneration with the import-fidelity fix requires adoption of its reviewed release in both pins; the next scheduled sync using that release can then regenerate the existing sync PRs. Keep rollout as separately authorized work; the import-fidelity task does not change or dispatch consumer workflows."
